# Model weights are large (~277-364 MB each) -> Git LFS.
# All fine-tuned / pretrained checkpoints under vcm-v2/ are tracked via LFS.
# (Raw best.pt / last.pt state_dicts for the w2v2 attempt are git-ignored;
#  the small CTC me2_v8 .pt checkpoints are force-added, see MIGRATION.md.)
*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
